5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,720
Before we do that, we're going
to start with a refresher

6
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:14,540
knowledge.

7
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:37,440
One of the things that's fairly
good evidence about in terms

8
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,750
