563
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:58,150
you're picking, if you
select things at random,

564
00:26:58,150 --> 00:27:01,170
you're always going to be making
some bad decision at each time

565
00:27:01,170 --> 00:27:04,056
point, OK?

