00:28:20,490 --> 00:28:24,790
exists at least one action
such that the gap is nonzero.

590
00:28:24,790 --> 00:28:27,038
That means that not
all arms are tied.

591
00:28:27,038 --> 00:28:28,830
If all arms are tied,
again, doesn't really

592
00:28:28,830 --> 00:28:30,700
matter what you do because
everything is the same.

593
00:28:30,700 --> 00:28:32,617
And so it doesn't matter
what action you take.

594
00:28:32,617 --> 00:28:35,250
So this makes it a nontrivial
