653
00:32:33,740 --> 00:32:36,240
Now, it turns out there are
certainly better and worse ways

654
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,360
of setting epsilon.

655
00:32:37,360 --> 00:32:41,160
But if you just set
epsilon in a static way,

656
00:32:41,160 --> 00:32:42,550
it can be pretty bad.

657
00:32:42,550 --> 00:32:45,340
And as you might remember
